---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import heroImage from "../assets/kali-harmen-current.jpg";
import mainHeroImage from "../assets/home-page-hero.jpg";
import workWithMeImage from "../assets/card-work-with-me.png";
import journalImage from "../assets/card-read-the-journal.png";
import speakingImage from "../assets/card-speaking.jpg";
import bookCoverImage from "../assets/book-cover.jpg";
import definitionImage from "../assets/dtbf-definition.jpg";

const posts = (await getCollection("blog"))
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.date.valueOf() - a.data.date.valueOf())
  .slice(0, 3);
const withBase = (path = "") => `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")}/${path}`;
const journalSlots = Array.from({ length: 3 }, (_, index) => posts[index] ?? null);
---

<BaseLayout title="Dare to Break Free | Stories of Living, Learning & Letting Go">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <Image
      class="home-hero__media"
      src={mainHeroImage}
      alt=""
      widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600, 1920, 2400]}
      sizes="100vw"
      format="webp"
      quality={82}
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <div class="home-hero__copy">
      <h1>When Playing It Safe Starts to Feel Risky</h1>
      <div class="hero-intro-copy">
        <p><strong>If life isn't quite working out the way you thought it would, you're probably in the right place.</strong></p>
      </div>
      <nav class="hero-paths" aria-label="Homepage paths">
        <a href={withBase("share-your-story/")}>Work with me</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a href={withBase("blog/")}>Read the Journal</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a href={withBase("contact/")}>Invite me to speak</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-section intro-panel">
    <div class="intro-panel__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Intro</p>
      <h2>Hi, I'm Kali.</h2>
      <div class="editorial-copy stack">
        <p><strong>Author of <em>Dare to Break Free: Drugs, Sex & Serendipity</em>.</strong></p>
        <p>For all the years I've spent coaching, studying psychology and doing more personal development than I can even account for, it was somewhere around revision 21 of my memoir that I began to really understand my story, and how much of it I was still censoring.</p>
        <p>I'd always been told, <strong>“Don't air your dirty laundry.”</strong> Instead, I'm letting mine fly free. Why? Because I will no longer let shame have a hold over me.</p>
        <p>What happened to us matters. So does what we made it mean. Sometimes that stuff is still having a say in our lives long after we thought we'd dealt with it.</p>
        <p>I'm not pretending I've got the answers. I've learnt a lot along the way, but I still get stuck, trip myself up and have to find my way through things I thought I'd already figured out.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="image-placeholder editorial-image hero-image--photo">
      <Image
        src={heroImage}
        alt="Portrait of Kali Harmen"
        widths={[480, 720, 960, 1200]}
        sizes="(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 38vw"
        format="webp"
        quality={82}
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="healing-section">
    <div class="pathways-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Start here</p>
      <h2>Choose Your Starting Point</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reflection-grid">
      <article class="reflection-card">
        <div class="image-placeholder reflection-image">
          <Image src={workWithMeImage} alt="" widths={[480, 720, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 980px) 100vw, 31vw" format="webp" quality={82} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <h3>Find Your Words</h3>
        <p>Got something you're trying to get hold of, work through, say or bring into the world?</p>
        <p>I work one-to-one with people who need useful questions, someone to spot the thread and another brain in the room.</p>
        <a class="button secondary light-button" href={withBase("share-your-story/")}>See how I work</a>
      </article>
      <article class="reflection-card">
        <div class="image-placeholder reflection-image">
          <Image src={journalImage} alt="" widths={[480, 720, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 980px) 100vw, 31vw" format="webp" quality={82} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <h3>The Journal</h3>
        <p><strong>The book ends. I didn't.</strong></p>
        <p>This is where I write about life now: midlife, ADHD, work, ambition, shame, sex, relationships and whatever else refuses to leave my brain alone.</p>
        <a class="button secondary light-button" href={withBase("blog/")}>Read the Journal</a>
      </article>
      <article class="reflection-card">
        <div class="image-placeholder reflection-image">
          <Image src={speakingImage} alt="" widths={[480, 720, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 980px) 100vw, 31vw" format="webp" quality={82} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
        <h3>Speaking</h3>
        <p>If you're looking for someone to speak who isn't going to give you a polished story about overcoming adversity and then pretend everything worked out perfectly afterwards, let's talk.</p>
        <a class="button secondary light-button" href={withBase("contact/")}>Invite me to speak</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section latest-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Journal</p>
      <h2>Latest from the Journal</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="post-grid journal-preview-grid">
      {journalSlots.map((post, index) => (
        post ? (
          <article class="post-card journal-preview-card">
            <div class="image-placeholder journal-entry-image">
              <Image src={journalImage} alt="" widths={[480, 720, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 980px) 100vw, 31vw" format="webp" quality={78} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            </div>
            <p class="eyebrow">{index === 0 ? "Most recent Journal entry" : `${index + 1}${index === 1 ? "nd" : "rd"} most recent Journal entry`}</p>
            <h3><a href={withBase(`blog/${post.slug}/`)}>{post.data.title}</a></h3>
            <p>{post.data.excerpt}</p>
          </article>
        ) : (
          <article class="post-card journal-preview-card journal-preview-card--empty">
            <div class="image-placeholder journal-entry-image">
              <Image src={journalImage} alt="" widths={[480, 720, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 980px) 100vw, 31vw" format="webp" quality={78} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            </div>
            <p class="eyebrow">{index === 1 ? "Second most recent Journal entry" : "Third most recent Journal entry"}</p>
            <h3>More journal entries coming soon</h3>
            <p>New writing will appear here as the Journal grows.</p>
          </article>
        )
      ))}
    </div>
    <a class="button secondary light-button" href={withBase("blog/")}>See all Journal entries</a>
  </section>

  <section class="themes-section about-snapshot">
    <div class="themes-section__heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2>A bit about me</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-snapshot__copy stack">
      <p>The short version is, I've taken a fairly unconventional route.</p>
      <p>I've been an addict, an escort, self-employed for most of my adult life, a personal trainer, nutritional therapist, coach, mature student, marketer and now author.</p>
      <p>It’s a strange mix, but they’ve all played their part in getting me here.</p>
      <a class="button secondary light-button" href={withBase("about/")}>Read more about me</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="definition-section">
    <div class="definition-section__inner">
      <div class="definition-section__image">
        <Image
          src={definitionImage}
          alt="Dare to Break Free, phrase. To stop pretending everything's fine when you know it isn't. To choose the unknown over staying stuck, despite having absolutely no idea what happens next."
          widths={[480, 720, 960, 1200]}
          sizes="(max-width: 980px) 100vw, 38vw"
          format="webp"
          quality={82}
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="definition-section__copy">
        <p>Sometimes you’ve just got to start somewhere.</p>
        <p>Being honest with yourself about what’s actually going on.</p>
        <p>Doing something about that thing you know isn’t helping but keep doing anyway.</p>
        <p>Admitting the path you’re on isn’t working.</p>
        <p>Or finally giving some attention to the idea you can’t quite leave alone.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="memoir-section">
    <div class="memoir-section__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Memoir</p>
      <h2>The Memoir</h2>
      <div class="stack">
        <p>Dare to Break Free started as an idea in 2009 and took seventeen years to finish. Two degrees, a few businesses and a lot of life happened in between.</p>
        <p>It isn’t a polished redemption story. It’s what I actually lived.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button secondary light-button" href={withBase("book/")}>About the book</a>
    </div>
    <div class="image-placeholder book-image">
      <Image
        src={bookCoverImage}
        alt="Dare to Break Free memoir"
        widths={[360, 540, 720, 960]}
        sizes="(max-width: 1080px) 80vw, 28vw"
        format="webp"
        quality={82}
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
